      "updated": 1793115593762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Frontend Unit Tests.\n- These are going to be difficult to set up because\nthere's so much tooling and external dependencies.\n- for example you need to call a backend, which is\nan external dependency, this adds complications because\nyou need to add a whole wack load of mocks",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frontend Unit Tests.\n- These are going to be difficult to set up because\nthere's so much tooling and external dependencies.\n- for example you need to call a backend, which is\nan external dependency, this adds complications because\nyou need to add a whole wack load of mocks",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
